  "meta": {
    "title": "Contains 001",
    "blurb": "Sipser’s worked example of designing a DFA by asking what to remember: nothing useful yet, a 0, 00, or the whole pattern. After 00 a further 0 changes nothing — the last two symbols are still 00.",
